direction: down
source: Layercake GeoParquet (HTTPS)
build: lakewing build
catalog: DuckLake catalog (small, on S3)
index: serving index sidecar (spatial file partitions)
parquet: Clustered Parquet files (S3)
pool: Shared read-only connection pool
http: Huma OGC Features + XYZ MVT
flight: Arrow Flight (native Arrow batches)

source -> build: bbox-pruned range reads
build -> catalog: atomic publish
build -> parquet: data files first (direct S3 writes)
build -> index: per-file bboxes
catalog -> pool: mountpoint-S3 mount, pinned snapshot
index -> pool: candidate files per request
parquet -> pool: mount reads via node-local disk cache
pool -> http
pool -> flight
